{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9c6e26ec-d3ac-8763-9ea2-4ae408f534c6",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:02:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Holly Thurston",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:59:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:59:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Tony. This is Holly Thurston. Let me explain what's going on, because it's a bit of a story. I'm at 341 Gidley Street, in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:59:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mrs. Thurston, go ahead. I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:59:19-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, first, bear with me a second, I'm on the step stool changing a lightbulb in the hall and I have the phone tucked on my shoulder. There. Got it. Now. Last month I got my water and sewer bill, and it was much higher than it's ever been. More than double."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:59:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Double. Okay. Did anything change at the house? More people staying, a leak, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T13:59:44-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nothing. It's just me. I checked the toilets with the dye, I looked at the faucets, nothing is running. So I paid it anyway, because I didn't want a late notice. I wrote it out on the check through my bank, and then last week I got a letter from the bank saying it bounced."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:00:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I see. So the payment came back to us as returned."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:00:09-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what I'm calling about. It wasn't that there wasn't money, I want to be clear. I had moved some things between accounts, and I think the timing was off. That's my mistake. But I'd like to know the status. Is it showing as unpaid now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:00:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull up the account. Gidley Street, 341, you said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:00:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 341."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:00:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I see it. Yes, the payment was reversed on our end, so the full balance is open again. It's not past due yet, but it's coming up on the due date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:00:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's irritating. All right. Then here's my question. With a bill that size, is a payment plan possible? I can't put out the whole amount at once right now, not after this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:00:57-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A lot of folks ask that, and there's usually some way to split it up. I can't set the terms myself from this desk, but I can put a note on the account and have someone from the billing office call you to set it up. Would that work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:01:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be fine. Use the number I'm calling from, 401-555-0182."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:01:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0182. And I'll note that the bounced payment was your bank, so they know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:01:26-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Now the other thing. I don't believe that bill. Can the meter be tested? If it's reading wrong, I don't want to set up a plan for a number that's not real."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:01:39-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, you can request a meter test. Basically they check whether the meter's reading accurately. Sometimes they also look at the reading itself, to make sure it was read right. I'll put in the request along with the note."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:01:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Does it cost anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:01:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't want to tell you wrong on that. The person who calls you will go over it. They'll explain what happens with the bill while the test is pending, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:02:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I'd just like to be sure I'm not charged twice for the same thing, the returned check and then a fee on top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:02:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll flag that in the note too. Anything else on your account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:02:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's everything. I know the storm was Friday and Saturday and you're probably swamped, so I appreciate your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:02:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble. You should hear from billing in the next day or two. Take care, Mrs. Thurston, and don't fall off that stool."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:02:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll be careful. Thank you, Tony. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
